Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f2903c8e-21e4-31e6-86aa-e396fc999a04.xml</text>
